<title>USA: Allied Products Corp Year net up.</title>
<headline>Allied Products Corp Year net up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended December 31,</p>
<p>						   Pro Forma     Actual</p>
<p>					 1996	  1995	   1995</p>
<p> Net sales		 $274,414,000 $260,861,000 $260,861,000</p>
<p> Income before taxes     29,708,000   20,220,000   18,330,000</p>
<p>Provision for income taxes:</p>
<p> Current			  921,000	989,000	989,000</p>
<p> Deferred		     9,783,000    6,465,000  (16,648,000)</p>
<p> Net income		  19,004,000   12,766,000   33,989,000</p>
<p>Net income applicable</p>
<p>  to common stock	  19,004,000   11,566,000   32,789,000</p>
<p>Earnings per common share:</p>
<p> Primary			     2.11	   1.23	   3.48</p>
<p> Fully diluted		     2.11	   1.22	   3.45</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding:</p>
<p> Primary			9,014,000    9,414,000    9,414,000</p>
<p> Fully diluted		9,014,000    9,494,000    9,494,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Pro forma results for 1995 eliminate $27.4 million one-time credit to net income related to recognition of a deferred tax asset for accumulated net operating losses carried over from prior years and provides a normal tax provision. Also eliminated is the amortization of goodwill in 1995 related to goodwill reduced by additional net operating loss carryforwards recognized that were acquired in merger transactions.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
